    {
        "id": 7,
        "raw": "[name=\"Hoshiguma\"]  That was easier than I expected. Really makes me more and more curious as to what happened in Chernobog.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Hoshiguma",
        "content": "That was easier than I expected. Really makes me more and more curious as to what happened in Chernobog."
    },
    {
        "id": 8,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 9,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ch'en\"]  Perhaps it's the same thing as what happened here, except the roots sank in deeper and the flames burned with more intensity. Don't let your guard down.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ch'en",
        "content": "Perhaps it's the same thing as what happened here, except the roots sank in deeper and the flames burned with more intensity. Don't let your guard down."
    },
    {
        "id": 10,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 11,
        "raw": "[name=\"Hoshiguma\"]  You should know that I rarely close my eyes when I'm sleeping.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Hoshiguma",
        "content": "You should know that I rarely close my eyes when I'm sleeping."
    },
    {
        "id": 12,
        "raw": "[name=\"Hoshiguma\"]  Ugh. I was trying to end the fighting as soon as possible, but we still ended up damaging so many shops.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Hoshiguma",
        "content": "Ugh. I was trying to end the fighting as soon as possible, but we still ended up damaging so many shops."
    },
    {
        "id": 13,
        "raw": "[name=\"Hoshiguma\"]  I'm afraid Mister Wei is going to end up footing the bill again, especially because he's not fond of the li'l Miss's family in the first place.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Hoshiguma",
        "content": "I'm afraid Mister Wei is going to end up footing the bill again, especially because he's not fond of the li'l Miss's family in the first place."
    },
    {
        "id": 14,
        "raw": "[name=\"Hoshiguma\"]  Hey, it's Swarovski Crystal. Ch'en, isn't this your favorite brand?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Hoshiguma",
        "content": "Hey, it's Swarovski Crystal. Ch'en, isn't this your favorite brand?"
    },
    {
        "id": 15,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 16,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ch'en\"]  Not really. The pendants are nice, but the earrings aren't that good.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ch'en",
        "content": "Not really. The pendants are nice, but the earrings aren't that good."
    },
    {
        "id": 17,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_010_chen_1#1\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1"
    },
    {
        "id": 18,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ch'en\"]  Squad B1, Ch'en here. Block the west entrance and lower all the security gates.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ch'en",
        "content": "Squad B1, Ch'en here. Block the west entrance and lower all the security gates."
    },
    {
        "id": 19,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 20,
        "raw": "[name=\"Hoshiguma\"]  I rarely see you wear earrings.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Hoshiguma",
        "content": "I rarely see you wear earrings."
    },
    {
        "id": 21,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 22,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ch'en\"]  Well, I'm usually in uniform because of work. The few outfits I do have are gathering cobwebs in my wardrobe.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ch'en",
        "content": "Well, I'm usually in uniform because of work. The few outfits I do have are gathering cobwebs in my wardrobe."
    },
    {
        "id": 23,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_015_lmg\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_015_lmg"
    },
    {
        "id": 24,
        "raw": "[name=\"L.G.D. Agent\"]  Madam Hoshiguma! This is the L3 floor plan of East Paci Plaza after Reunion modified it. Please look over it!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "L.G.D. Agent",
        "content": "Madam Hoshiguma! This is the L3 floor plan of East Paci Plaza after Reunion modified it. Please look over it!"
    },
    {
        "id": 25,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\",name2=\"char_015_lmg\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_015_lmg",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 26,
        "raw": "[name=\"Hoshiguma\"]  Good job. Continue with the investigation, and try to utilize the terrain to our advantage.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Hoshiguma",
        "content": "Good job. Continue with the investigation, and try to utilize the terrain to our advantage."
    },
    {
        "id": 27,
        "raw": "[name=\"Hoshiguma\"]  Afterwards, we'll find the best route to cross Reunion's blockade from here. We can't make do without your information.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Hoshiguma",
        "content": "Afterwards, we'll find the best route to cross Reunion's blockade from here. We can't make do without your information."
    },
    {
        "id": 28,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\",name2=\"char_015_lmg\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_015_lmg",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 29,
        "raw": "[name=\"L.G.D. Agent\"]  Roger!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "L.G.D. Agent",
        "content": "Roger!"
    },
    {
        "id": 30,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 31,
        "raw": "[name=\"Hoshiguma\"]  Clothes, huh... It's hard picturing you as someone who spends money on that kind of stuff.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Hoshiguma",
        "content": "Clothes, huh... It's hard picturing you as someone who spends money on that kind of stuff."
    },
    {
        "id": 32,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 33,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ch'en\"]  Aren't you the same way with your countless motorbikes? What's wrong with wanting to look nice for yourself every now and then?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ch'en",
        "content": "Aren't you the same way with your countless motorbikes? What's wrong with wanting to look nice for yourself every now and then?"
    },
    {
        "id": 34,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ch'en\"]  Work takes up most of my time, but it's not my whole life after all.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ch'en",
        "content": "Work takes up most of my time, but it's not my whole life after all."
    },
    {
        "id": 35,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 36,
        "raw": "[name=\"Hoshiguma\"]  I'd be more likely to believe you if you didn't show up early every morning like clockwork, as well as taking on overtime hours that would scare anyone else to death.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Hoshiguma",
        "content": "I'd be more likely to believe you if you didn't show up early every morning like clockwork, as well as taking on overtime hours that would scare anyone else to death."
    },
    {
        "id": 37,
        "raw": "[name=\"Hoshiguma\"]  I guess all you can say is that life is tolerable for cops like us.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Hoshiguma",
        "content": "I guess all you can say is that life is tolerable for cops like us."
    },
    {
        "id": 38,
        "raw": "[name=\"Hoshiguma\"]  Sometimes I ask myself, for those Infected like Amiya... Will they have a chance to go out shopping? Maybe to buy some accessories they like, or eat some of their favorite food?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Hoshiguma",
        "content": "Sometimes I ask myself, for those Infected like Amiya... Will they have a chance to go out shopping? Maybe to buy some accessories they like, or eat some of their favorite food?"
    },
    {
        "id": 39,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 40,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ch'en\"]  Perhaps one day. But that day is not here yet.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ch'en",
        "content": "Perhaps one day. But that day is not here yet."
    },
    {
        "id": 41,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_010_chen_1#1\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1"
    },
    {
        "id": 42,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ch'en\"]  C3, Ch'en here. Clear the first floor and push forward slowly. Safety first.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ch'en",
        "content": "C3, Ch'en here. Clear the first floor and push forward slowly. Safety first."
    },
    {
        "id": 43,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 44,
        "raw": "[name=\"Hoshiguma\"]  I guess so. This patch of dirt truly is unfair. Phal died, but I get to live on.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Hoshiguma",
        "content": "I guess so. This patch of dirt truly is unfair. Phal died, but I get to live on."
    },
    {
        "id": 45,
        "raw": "[name=\"Hoshiguma\"]  They all died, and only I got to live.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Hoshiguma",
        "content": "They all died, and only I got to live."
    },
    {
        "id": 46,
        "raw": "[name=\"Hoshiguma\"]  Ch'en. Is that intel really worthwhile?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Hoshiguma",
        "content": "Ch'en. Is that intel really worthwhile?"
    },
    {
        "id": 47,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 48,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ch'en\"]  It has to be.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ch'en",
        "content": "It has to be."
    },
